# The ThreadSanitizer suppressions of the known races, which are left as they
# are for now. The tests of the threads sanitizer build (ENABLE_SANITIZERS_THREADS)
# pass the file by the TSAN_OPTIONS environment variable, while the rest of the
# races are reported the usual way.
#
# The training threads of the yolo layer count the ground truth boxes of the
# training statistics in the shared network counter with no synchronization, the
# same way the original Darknet does. The race_top type suppresses the races
# of the process_batch function body alone, not of the functions it calls.
race_top:process_batch
